          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App container": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contenedor de la app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App containers hold data managed by other apps; reading them makes macOS ask for permission.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los contenedores guardan datos administrados por otras apps; leerlos hace que macOS pida permiso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App scripts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scripts de la app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple considers a battery consumed when it reaches about 80% of its original capacity. macOS shows its own recommendation in System Settings › Battery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple considera que una batería está consumida cuando llega a cerca del 80% de su capacidad original. macOS muestra su propia recomendación en Configuración del sistema › Batería."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's internal SSDs do not publish detailed wear data to apps. Noria shows SMART status only when macOS reports it; Disk Utility › First Aid checks the file system.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los SSD internos de Apple no publican datos detallados de desgaste para las apps. Noria muestra el estado SMART solo cuando macOS lo informa; Utilidad de Discos › Primera ayuda revisa el sistema de archivos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Application": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aplicación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archivo comprimido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one copy of every file is always kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siempre se conserva al menos una copia de cada archivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attachments of “%@”. This account keeps mail only on this Mac (or its type could not be confirmed), so these may be the only copies. Noria does not remove them; delete large messages from Mail instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjuntos de «%@». Esta cuenta guarda el correo solo en este Mac (o no se pudo confirmar su tipo), así que pueden ser las únicas copias. Noria no los elimina; borra los mensajes grandes desde Mail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic selection keeps the oldest copy, preferring copies outside Downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La selección automática conserva la copia más antigua, preferentemente fuera de Descargas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background launcher": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lanzador en segundo plano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backup": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copia de seguridad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Batería"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery health and per-process activity arrive with Mac Health and Performance (phase 3).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La salud de la batería y la actividad por proceso llegarán con Salud del Mac y Rendimiento (fase 3)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before acting, Noria re-checks every item: anything that changed since the scan, is protected, or is excluded is skipped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antes de actuar, Noria vuelve a comprobar cada elemento: se omite todo lo que haya cambiado desde el análisis, esté protegido o excluido."
          }
        }
