            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuarentena"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quarantine is empty": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cuarentena está vacía"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quarantine keeps cleaned items inside Noria so you can restore them from History; they are deleted for good after the chosen number of days. Moving to the Trash lets you use Finder’s Put Back. In both cases space is freed only when the items are finally deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cuarentena guarda lo que limpias dentro de Noria para que puedas restaurarlo desde Historial; se elimina definitivamente tras los días elegidos. Mover a la Papelera te permite usar «Devolver» en Finder. En ambos casos el espacio solo se libera cuando los elementos se eliminan del todo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quarantined": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
