    "The app and the selected files will be removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se eliminarán la app y los archivos seleccionados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is asked to quit normally, so it can save your work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se le pide a la app que se cierre normalmente, para que pueda guardar tu trabajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app recreates it if needed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app lo vuelve a crear si lo necesita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app stays installed; only the selected files are removed (useful to reset it).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app sigue instalada; solo se eliminan los archivos seleccionados (útil para restablecerla)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's settings return to their defaults.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los ajustes de la app vuelven a sus valores por defecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The application itself. Quit it first. If it came from the App Store you can download it again at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La aplicación en sí. Ciérrala antes. Si vino de la App Store, puedes volver a descargarla cuando quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cache folder “%@” takes %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carpeta de caché «%1$@» ocupa %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time, macOS asks you to allow access to your Home folder. Noria only reads it until you confirm a cleanup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La primera vez, macOS te pedirá permitir el acceso a tu carpeta de inicio. Noria solo la lee hasta que confirmes una limpieza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The originals stay on the server and Mail downloads them again when needed. Set Mail to download only recent attachments first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los originales siguen en el servidor y Mail los vuelve a descargar cuando hacen falta. Configura antes Mail para descargar solo los adjuntos recientes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
